{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:43:32.665977", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1 to switch_8). Each host (host_1 to host_8) is connected to an edge switch, and all hosts share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The switches also participate in a management/control network (20.0.0.0/24), with an SDN controller running at 20.0.0.100, configured to use OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### Observations\\n1. **Reachability Test Results**:\\n   - The ping results between hosts indicate that all tests returned a status of \"unknown.\"\\n   - No data was transmitted (`tx`), received (`rx`), or measured for packet loss, round-trip time (RTT), or other metrics.\\n   - This suggests that there is a significant issue preventing communication between hosts.\\n\\n2. **Potential Anomalies**:\\n   - The inability to establish communication between hosts could indicate:\\n     - A failure in the central switch (switch_0), which serves as the hub in the star topology.\\n     - Misconfiguration or failure in the SDN controller (20.0.0.100) responsible for managing the switches.\\n     - Issues with OpenFlow connectivity between switches and the controller.\\n     - Problems with the edge switches or their connections to hosts.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nTo further diagnose the root cause, the following areas need investigation:\\n1. **Central Switch (switch_0)**:\\n   - Verify its operational status and connectivity to edge switches.\\n   - Check OpenFlow configuration and logs.\\n\\n2. **Edge Switches (switch_1 to switch_8)**:\\n   - Confirm their connectivity to hosts and the central switch.\\n   - Inspect their OpenFlow configuration and logs.\\n\\n3. **SDN Controller**:\\n   - Validate its connectivity to switches and its ability to manage flows.\\n   - Check for any errors or misconfigurations in the controller.\\n\\n4. **Host Network Configuration**:\\n   - Ensure hosts are correctly configured with IP addresses in the 10.0.0.0/24 subnet.\\n   - Verify their ability to communicate with their respective edge switches.\\n\\n#### Summary\\nThe network is experiencing a complete communication failure between hosts. The root cause is likely related to the central switch, edge switches, or the SDN controller. Further investigation is required to pinpoint the exact issue., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='32065e62-e647-4bc5-a45d-b6eb232e9a94'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
